{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫שֶׁק","hw":"נֶ֫שֶׁק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫שֶׁק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ֫שֶׁק</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>equipment, weapons</strong> (coll.), <strong>armoury</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫שֶׁק</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.9\">Ez 39:9</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ֫שֶׁק</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.25\">1 K 10:25</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.24\">2 Ch 9:24</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָ֑שֶׁק</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.2\">2 K 10:2</a> + 2 times, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.8\">Is 22:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:24\" href=\"/Job.20.24\">Jb 20:24</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>equipment, weapons</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.25\">1 K 10:25</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.2\">2 K 10:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.8\">Is 22:8</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.24\">2 Ch 9:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.9\">Ez 39:9</a> (gen. term, foll. by specif.), v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.10\">10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ בַּרְזֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:24\" href=\"/Job.20.24\">Jb 20:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶשֶׁת נְחשֶׁת</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם נָ֑שֶׁק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:8\" href=\"/Psalms.140.8\">ψ 140:8</a> i.e. day of battle; so <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> alone <a data-ref=\"Job 39:21\" href=\"/Job.39.21\">Jb 39:21</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  appar. <em>armoury</em> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.19\">Ne 3:19</a>.","next":"BDB, נֶשֶׁר","prev":"BDB, נָשַׁק²"}